# Flags every Codex team session starts with (team-up --codex, team-worker, Research Desk's Start team), one per line;
# a leading ~ is expanded. Each launcher adds the effort: medium for the desk and driver, xhigh for a worker.
# The sandbox lets it write in the project and use the network (ssh, herdr); --add-dir is where ask-human writes.
-m
gpt-6-astra
-s
workspace-write
-c
sandbox_workspace_write.network_access=true
--add-dir
~/.config/research-harness
-a
never
